{"h":"<p>对于 LoRA，在通配符处理器中选择它们，然后将它们复制到下面的文本字段中。</p><p>在工作流程中导航的快捷方式是<strong>1</strong>,<strong>2</strong>,<strong>3</strong>,<strong>4</strong>.</p><p><strong>自由U_V2</strong>与动画效果不佳，所以我将其绕过。有一条注释应该有助于设置其值。</p><p>使用<strong>ADetailer（面部细节器）</strong>, <strong>高档的</strong>或<strong>控制网</strong>, <strong>等等</strong>单击启用组按钮<strong>快速组旁路器 (rg Three)</strong>左上角。</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/brad-twinkl/controlnet-union-sdxl-1.0-promax/blob/main/diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">基于 SDXL 的检查点的 controlnet 模型</a></p><p><a href=\"https://webapp.magicposer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">3D 摆姿势（需要具有硬件加速功能的浏览器）</a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/wtz37/sdxl/blob/main/noobIPAMARK1_mark1.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">noobIPAMARK1_mark1.safetensors</a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/clip_vision_g/blob/main/clip_vision_g.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfyanonymous/clip_vision_g</a></p><p>在 1440p 显示屏上效果最佳。 >:]</p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}